                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>FLOODING NO LONGER EXPECTED AT INGLEWOOD BRIDGE</p>

				<p/>
				<p>Flooding is no longer expected along Macintyre Brook at Inglewood Bridge after peaking well below the minor flood level early Wednesday morning. As these flows travel downstream, small river level rises are expected along the Macintyre River at Boggabilla and Goondiwindi late this week but are expected to remain well below minor flood levels.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Below Minor</element>
